<title>USA: Huaneng Power Intl 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Huaneng Power Intl 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Earnings/ADS	     10.65		     9.62</p>
<p> Net		    1,333,440		1,202,564</p>
<p> Net oper revs	4,837,372		4,589,361</p>
<p> Avg ADS		  125,000		  125,000</p>
<p>(All data in 000s of renminbi except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: In U.S. dollars, the company earned net income of $160.4 million in 1996 on net operating revenues of $582.9 million. Earnings per American Depositary Share (ADS) were $1.28.</p>
<p>Each ADS represents 40 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>Full company name is Huaneng Power International Inc.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
